WEBVTT

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:44.240
There are two poles in the sky, namely, the north and the south.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:51.650
The two poles of Shinra Bansho, the man and the woman.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:58.840
Intouyo, the sword of assassination, and the sword of death.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.990
I will not fight with justice.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:09.410
If I fight, this world will be destroyed.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:15.590
When the unification of the north and the south occurs, the savior will appear.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:00.880
Thank you.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:43.690
In the 1990s, the world was surrounded by fire.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:40.350
The people who were forced to fight for death were only for water and food.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:14.950
This used to be the sea, but now there are only pieces of life left.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:22.690
I want to see the day when the green returns to the ground and the fish returns to the sea.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:49.570
This is the beginning of a new era of justice.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.420
A strong man can do whatever he likes without hesitation.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:07.490
Get out of my way!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:11.340
Kenshiro, you seem to have become the legend of the North Shinkens.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.520
But you're not the enemy of the government!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.640
Shin, we can't fight the North and South.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:19.740
Did you forget that that was the rule?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.940
I forgot that long ago!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.140
I'll make you rot in hell.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.710
Damn it! Is that the legend of Hokuto Shinken, big brother?

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:28.890
Kenshiro...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.680
I can't win against you.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.640
There's a fatal difference between you and me.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.100
It's...

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.920
Desire.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.230
And...

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:40.710
Death.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:42.660
Ken!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.020
We've been siblings since we were kids!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.700
And your master told us not to fight the North and South!

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.440
Yuria.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.400
You're a woman who draws the blood of the government.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:02.710
Don't you get it, Yuria?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.450
I've always loved you.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.740
Brother, we Hokuto Shinken are one of a kind.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.580
There's only one person who can take over.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.980
And yet, the legendary Kenshiro...

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:27.220
I know that the people who lost the battle of the passers-by of the North Shinken are

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:27.660
How

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.060
I

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:35.620
Some were crushed by their fists, some were stolen from their memories.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.590
Are you still silent, Raoh?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:44.600
Kenshiro.

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:46.310
Desire leads to strength.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.230
You don't have that.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:54.240
Kenshiro, with your naive personality, you can't live in this era.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.640
Only I can make Yuria happy.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.060
Yuria, if you love me, say it.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.660
I love you, Tenshiro.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.630
If you kill Ken, I'll die too.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.650
Oh, you don't want to say that?

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:39.510
How many times do I have to die?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:51.090
You're the only one who can stop me.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:54.310
You have only one word to say.

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.530
I won't force you.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:57.180
Say it with your own will.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.390
If you're going to kill me, then go ahead and do it.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:06.050
Yulia, don't die.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.760
Keep on living for me.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.460
Fine, I'll kill you.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.300
Die!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.540
I couldn't forgive you for who you are.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:17.870
Die!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.840
Stop it, Yulia!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.700
I love you.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.080
What? You can't hear me?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:41.310
You think my heart will move just by that?

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.500
Yulia, if you want my love...

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:45.740
Say it clearly!

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:16.130
Did you hear that, Kenshiro?

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:21.980
A woman who hates me to death will follow me wherever I go in my life.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.010
A woman's heart is a terrible thing, isn't it?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.140
Ah, Yulia, this man is already dead.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.320
He can't live in this era.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.900
Don't worry, he can't hit the end.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:07.790
It's me, Yulia.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:09.840
Yulia!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:10.400
What?

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.420
That's it for Kenshiro.

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:25.920
You should pick up Hokuto.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.780
I'll give it to you.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:28.100
What?

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.480
Garao!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.050
A-A-Ani-chan!

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.110
Are you really okay, Garao?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.640
Yuria...

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:57.480
I will make flowers bloom again on this earth.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:24.770
Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:44.980
You're no match for me, Kenshiro!

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.960
From today on, I'm the legend of Hokuto Shinken!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.520
I won't let you run away from me, my best brother!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:15.790
Ah!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:20.600
Cree!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.700
Dad, can you crush my fist?

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.060
If you can crush it, then crush it!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:26.840
Even if you're my dad, you can't defeat me.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.570
Raoh, are you ready?

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:37.860
The one who couldn't achieve the goal of becoming the legend of Hokuto Shinken, be silent!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:50.110
I apologize to the legend of Hokuto Shinken.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:54.140
Nishirou is dead.

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:55.250
What?

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.110
Hokuto Shinken is already dead.

00:17:06.652 --> 00:17:07.152
Yeah!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:59.020
There is no one like you in this world, Raoh!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.000
What the hell are you talking about?

00:18:02.716 --> 00:18:05.756
The Hokuto Shinken shall never be used again!

00:18:06.588 --> 00:18:09.288
I don't take orders from anyone.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.380
My wish is...

00:18:18.524 --> 00:18:20.524
Ten!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.580
Hold on to the sword.

00:18:26.204 --> 00:18:29.984
It's not a problem for me to be a reporter of Hokuto Shinken!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:40.260
That would be good. But Raoh, I will seal your fist with my own hands.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.490
Answer me, God of Justice!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:57.300
My goal is Heaven!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.650
If you want to hinder me, you'll have to fight the gods and the demons!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:10.980
I shall be the one to end this century!

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:47.000
The time has passed, and the world is once again under the rule of violence.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.020
NOOOOOO

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:31.080
We'll be right back.

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:02.260
Eh, eh.

00:23:53.290 --> 00:23:55.360
They were in the middle of driving them to eat food.

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:57.610
You see, you see.

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:58.870
It's not going to move.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.480
Even so, it seems that the village of the kids earlier will be destroyed.

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:06.740
I'll have to tell my brother Jido soon.

00:24:08.110 --> 00:24:09.570
You're so annoying.

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:13.200
Hey!

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:17.730
Hey, you bastard, are you alive?

00:24:18.330 --> 00:24:19.920
Hey, my car!

00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:26.060
It's a healthy kid.

00:24:26.480 --> 00:24:28.520
Huh? What is this? Seeds?

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.810
I'll never be able to eat rice on a land like this again.

00:24:33.130 --> 00:24:36.940
What the hell are you doing?

00:24:37.540 --> 00:24:38.140
Hey!

00:24:39.560 --> 00:24:40.960
It's a pain in the ass to let this village know.

00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:42.740
Kill them all!

00:24:43.290 --> 00:24:46.050
Come on, come on, come on!

00:24:47.890 --> 00:24:49.920
What the hell are you doing?

00:24:50.120 --> 00:24:50.920
You bastard!

00:25:01.370 --> 00:25:02.690
Uh, come on.

00:26:01.310 --> 00:26:05.560
You did it

00:27:09.600 --> 00:27:10.360
Oh

00:27:31.560 --> 00:27:31.680
Cut!

00:28:02.750 --> 00:28:23.270
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:28:30.090 --> 00:28:37.860
Thank you for your viewing.

00:29:06.400 --> 00:29:10.970
Hey, Otaku, why did you save us at that time?

00:29:11.310 --> 00:29:14.280
That girl called me.

00:29:15.080 --> 00:29:16.060
That's ridiculous.

00:29:16.840 --> 00:29:18.880
That's strange.

00:29:20.500 --> 00:29:21.970
Rin can't talk.

00:29:23.220 --> 00:29:29.560
In the previous war, all the families were burned to death in front of their eyes.

00:29:30.990 --> 00:29:32.610
That shock made him unable to speak.

00:29:34.140 --> 00:29:36.240
Well, I'm just like him.

00:29:36.900 --> 00:29:40.340
But why was he the only one who survived?

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:00.400
Yeah.

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:00.760
Yeah.

00:30:00.960 --> 00:30:00.980
Yeah.

00:31:04.280 --> 00:31:05.900
Give Mr. Geed plenty of water and food.

00:31:07.340 --> 00:31:11.530
If you don't, I'll cut off this little girl's head.

00:31:12.690 --> 00:31:14.430
Elder, I don't care.

00:31:14.670 --> 00:31:15.330
Let's fight.

00:31:16.630 --> 00:31:17.750
I see.

00:31:18.270 --> 00:31:21.320
If you really don't cut it off, you won't understand.

00:31:32.650 --> 00:31:38.590
Who is it?

00:31:38.770 --> 00:31:40.790
The guy who made me eat stones.

00:31:41.410 --> 00:31:50.830
Bastard!

00:31:51.010 --> 00:31:53.360
Who the hell are you?

00:31:53.440 --> 00:31:54.920
You look like a bastard!

00:31:55.280 --> 00:31:55.600
What?

00:32:05.756 --> 00:32:07.756
You

00:32:10.876 --> 00:32:11.376
BITCH!

00:32:13.820 --> 00:32:14.320
No!

00:32:16.028 --> 00:32:16.528
SHUT!

00:32:30.860 --> 00:32:32.140
Uwaaaaaaah!

00:32:32.160 --> 00:32:46.290
Let go of that kid.

00:32:47.340 --> 00:32:49.080
Ugh, you little brat!

00:32:49.300 --> 00:32:50.600
I'll crush you to pieces!

00:33:30.630 --> 00:33:38.190
Your fists are even more powerful than mine.

00:33:38.350 --> 00:33:42.770
I'll kill you!

00:33:43.790 --> 00:33:46.020
You're already dead.

00:33:47.120 --> 00:33:47.420
What?

00:34:10.560 --> 00:34:11.180
Hokuto Shinken.

00:34:11.400 --> 00:34:15.200
Hokuto Shinken.

00:34:15.380 --> 00:34:20.280
Once upon a time, there was a terrifying murderous sword that was passed down from China.

00:34:20.580 --> 00:34:23.590
Its name was Hokuto Shinken.

00:34:23.950 --> 00:34:28.770
At first glance, it was full of energy, and it was shocking to see the body fall.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:34.900
It is a martial art that can destroy the surface, or rather, the internal destruction.

00:34:38.330 --> 00:34:55.230
Kenshiro, you are Rin, aren't you?

00:34:57.270 --> 00:34:59.080
It was you who called me.

00:35:04.570 --> 00:35:05.980
Rin, you're a good girl.

00:35:07.640 --> 00:35:09.200
It's okay. Don't move.

00:35:09.560 --> 00:35:26.900
I've got a secret weapon to get back what I said.

00:35:28.340 --> 00:35:28.720
Charm!

00:35:29.340 --> 00:35:29.500
I said I have it!

00:35:30.570 --> 00:35:30.790
No way!

00:35:31.310 --> 00:35:35.600
This bag contains flower seeds.

00:35:36.280 --> 00:35:42.110
In this era, you might be able to bloom flowers.

00:35:42.830 --> 00:35:43.350
Yeah.

00:36:00.510 --> 00:36:01.590
I've never seen such a cool guy before!

00:37:08.220 --> 00:37:09.220
Who the hell are you?!

00:37:09.240 --> 00:37:12.280
It's me. I'm Rei.

00:37:12.420 --> 00:37:14.850
Rei of the Suichoken.

00:37:15.510 --> 00:37:18.340
If I dress like a woman,

00:37:18.340 --> 00:37:19.590
I'll be able to get rid of

00:37:19.590 --> 00:37:20.550
all the bugs like you.

00:37:22.820 --> 00:37:24.620
Even if you're such a coward,

00:37:25.420 --> 00:37:27.500
there's only one thing I can do for you.

00:37:27.940 --> 00:37:29.840
Shut up.

00:37:30.060 --> 00:37:32.500
It's about bringing food even if you don't want to eat it.

00:37:32.600 --> 00:37:33.360
You're so annoying!

00:37:40.090 --> 00:37:40.430
You bastard!

00:37:43.080 --> 00:37:43.520
Forget it.

00:37:43.860 --> 00:37:56.920
It's me!

00:37:57.160 --> 00:37:58.210
You bastard!

00:38:01.280 --> 00:38:04.810
Hey, do you know the man with the seven scars?

00:38:06.270 --> 00:38:18.600
That's funny. I can't answer that.

00:38:20.540 --> 00:38:22.080
Alright, bring the next one.

00:38:23.170 --> 00:38:24.530
I don't want to. I don't know.

00:38:25.150 --> 00:38:29.030
Alright, you look smart. I'm sure you know.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:32.340
Now, tell me the name of this person.

00:38:32.940 --> 00:38:34.940
That's impossible! I don't know!

00:38:35.620 --> 00:38:36.180
What?

00:38:36.760 --> 00:38:41.070
You can't tell who it is by looking at the seven scars on this chest?

00:38:42.150 --> 00:38:44.980
This person is Lord Kenshiro, the legend of Hokuto Shinken.

00:38:46.980 --> 00:38:47.740
Tell me.

00:38:48.230 --> 00:38:49.460
Lord Kenshiro?

00:38:50.620 --> 00:38:52.240
That's right, it's Lord Kenshiro.

00:38:52.800 --> 00:38:53.600
You said it well.

00:38:53.820 --> 00:38:54.980
Okay, as a reward,

00:38:55.260 --> 00:38:57.740
I'll make you pull this guy's neck with your head.

00:38:58.540 --> 00:38:59.100
What?

00:38:59.400 --> 00:38:59.760
Oh, no!

00:39:00.640 --> 00:39:01.560
Where do you think you're going to keep it?

00:39:06.720 --> 00:39:08.040
Hurry up and do it!

00:39:11.160 --> 00:39:13.000
I can't do it! Please forgive me!

00:39:13.480 --> 00:39:14.860
What? You can't do it?

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:16.860
That's not what you're supposed to do, Keijiro-sama!

00:39:17.100 --> 00:39:17.520
Shut up!

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:26.000
A man with seven wounds who destroyed the Geed...

00:39:26.000 --> 00:39:27.300
Was he such a villain?

00:39:28.480 --> 00:39:29.630
In this world...

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:31.320
There is no such thing as a man with seven wounds!

00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:32.420
What did you say?

00:39:32.840 --> 00:39:33.480
Old man!

00:39:33.720 --> 00:39:34.320
One more time!

00:39:36.300 --> 00:39:39.240
That's right.

00:39:39.500 --> 00:39:42.570
The man with seven wounds was a man called Kenshiro of the North Shinkens.

00:39:48.060 --> 00:39:48.600
Wait!

00:39:50.770 --> 00:39:53.280
You're doing a good job.

00:39:53.860 --> 00:39:56.710
I'll give you a good reward.

00:39:56.710 --> 00:39:59.150
I'll give you a good reward.

00:40:00.800 --> 00:40:02.540
Does it feel good to play with a stick?

00:40:02.800 --> 00:40:03.800
That's right!

00:40:04.160 --> 00:40:04.920
It's refreshing!

00:40:05.460 --> 00:40:06.650
Go ahead and do it!

00:40:06.950 --> 00:40:07.310
Huh?

00:40:11.570 --> 00:40:14.600
It's refreshing!

00:40:15.140 --> 00:40:16.130
How is it?

00:40:16.150 --> 00:40:17.220
Did you get a hang of it?

00:40:17.600 --> 00:40:18.640
I-I didn't!

00:40:41.800 --> 00:40:43.660
Kamakiri, take me to the man with the seven wounds.

00:40:45.920 --> 00:40:46.320
You bastard!

00:40:52.520 --> 00:40:56.520
Don't you want to know the real name of that man?

00:40:58.630 --> 00:40:59.460
Shut up!

00:41:00.700 --> 00:41:01.060
You bastard!

00:41:01.520 --> 00:41:09.360
I'll teach you.

00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:14.080
Jagi!

00:41:14.180 --> 00:41:19.100
This is the man I once called my brother.

00:41:30.540 --> 00:41:39.400
Airi, polish it well.

00:41:39.420 --> 00:41:40.290
Yes, master.

00:41:41.180 --> 00:41:42.820
Polish it so that you can lick it.

00:41:43.860 --> 00:41:47.090
Are these shoes dirty?

00:41:47.670 --> 00:41:53.220
Don't you respect me even though I'm dirty?

00:42:00.990 --> 00:42:03.550
Why are you chasing me, no, the man with seven scars?

00:42:04.810 --> 00:42:08.620
I don't trust you yet.

00:42:09.220 --> 00:42:11.390
Ray, let me go.

00:42:11.470 --> 00:42:16.060
I have to defeat my brother, Jagi, for my own sake.

00:42:16.280 --> 00:42:21.700
Fine. It's not too late to defeat him.

00:42:21.720 --> 00:42:25.690
This cape was supposed to be for my sister's wedding.

00:42:30.730 --> 00:42:31.410
It sells as high as a young woman.

00:42:32.370 --> 00:42:41.030
While I was vacating the village, he killed all the villagers, killed his parents, and took Airi with him.

00:42:41.660 --> 00:42:43.520
That's the 7-scarred man.

00:43:14.110 --> 00:43:14.890
I don't accept my little brother becoming a messenger.

00:43:16.310 --> 00:43:18.090
Go to your father and tell him to stop!

00:43:20.020 --> 00:43:21.380
Brother, why do you rely on guns?

00:43:22.110 --> 00:43:23.610
Why don't you just fight with your sword?

00:43:24.230 --> 00:43:25.390
I don't think the Constitution is everything.

00:43:26.470 --> 00:43:28.490
I don't care what you do, as long as you win.

00:43:30.320 --> 00:43:33.170
Stop it, you bastard!

00:43:35.940 --> 00:43:41.160
I'm not going to let my little brother get away with this!

00:43:41.340 --> 00:43:42.460
I'm going to kill you!

00:44:00.320 --> 00:44:01.340
What's wrong with you?

00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:03.840
I'm gonna kill you!

00:44:04.400 --> 00:44:10.730
I'm gonna kill you!

00:44:11.890 --> 00:44:19.930
You don't have the right to be a legend.

00:44:20.350 --> 00:44:21.780
Disappear!

00:44:24.520 --> 00:44:29.380
Henshiro was alive.

00:44:30.380 --> 00:44:48.580
Jagi-san, I've called Heart.

00:44:48.920 --> 00:44:51.550
Huh? Jagi-san?

00:45:07.900 --> 00:45:08.520
Ah, ah, ah!

00:45:21.450 --> 00:45:24.170
Why are you so scared?

00:45:24.570 --> 00:45:26.870
Do you hate this face that much?

00:45:27.070 --> 00:45:29.160
It doesn't move, it doesn't move.

00:45:29.340 --> 00:45:29.940
You bastard.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:32.140
Well, you despise me, don't you?

00:45:32.380 --> 00:45:35.040
You made fun of my face, didn't you?

00:45:35.200 --> 00:45:37.700
That's... That's not what I meant...

00:45:37.950 --> 00:45:47.860
If you look at me more lightly than my brother, I'll let you live.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:03.320
So you're saying that your fake friend is here, locked up by Airi?

00:46:03.960 --> 00:46:06.020
I think so.

00:46:09.970 --> 00:46:11.670
They're finally here.

00:46:12.820 --> 00:46:15.230
Come here, Airi.

00:46:15.230 --> 00:46:17.600
You have an interesting way to use it.

00:46:18.620 --> 00:46:19.040
Yes, Master.

00:46:30.670 --> 00:46:46.880
Are you Kenshiro-kun?

00:46:47.340 --> 00:46:48.500
I am Heart.

00:46:48.840 --> 00:46:50.880
I have been ordered to take your life.

00:46:53.020 --> 00:46:54.710
You should sleep in a pig house.

00:46:56.690 --> 00:46:58.490
You think you can treat me like a pig?

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:00.800
It's Tokyo, isn't it?

00:47:01.000 --> 00:47:02.160
Well, welcome from wherever you are!

00:47:08.860 --> 00:47:10.640
My flesh is like rubber.

00:47:12.100 --> 00:47:15.020
Therefore, until your sword reaches Keiraku Shikou,

00:47:15.240 --> 00:47:17.560
everything will be absorbed by the wall of flesh.

00:47:19.100 --> 00:47:22.160
I have been killing all swords with this body!

00:47:24.540 --> 00:47:28.760
What's wrong?

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:30.640
Is this the end?

00:47:32.740 --> 00:47:35.490
What's wrong?

00:47:35.570 --> 00:47:36.710
Do you want me to do it?

00:47:37.590 --> 00:47:38.070
No need.

00:47:38.230 --> 00:47:40.670
Okuto Shinten is invincible.

00:47:41.200 --> 00:47:43.310
Is that so?

00:47:43.710 --> 00:47:44.530
Then die!

00:47:45.790 --> 00:47:46.730
Idiot!

00:48:00.670 --> 00:48:01.650
My meat!

00:48:02.130 --> 00:48:06.520
You are already a lump of fat.

00:48:06.860 --> 00:48:07.500
Die!

00:48:09.780 --> 00:48:13.360
What was that just now?

00:48:13.560 --> 00:48:15.260
Nwa! Nwa! Nwa!

00:48:54.800 --> 00:48:58.840
You're a good boy.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:17.750
You killed your parents and stole Aili's seven wounds.

00:49:19.510 --> 00:49:23.180
I heard that there was a man from Suichoken in that village.

00:49:23.280 --> 00:49:24.360
Was it you?

00:49:25.680 --> 00:49:26.200
Master!

00:49:30.410 --> 00:49:32.070
What should I do here?

00:49:32.610 --> 00:49:34.320
I'll do anything.

00:49:35.650 --> 00:49:43.860
I'm going to be replaced by a new master.

00:49:45.200 --> 00:49:48.010
Please take care of me.

00:49:48.310 --> 00:49:49.830
I'll do anything.

00:49:50.890 --> 00:49:53.220
Hai, your eyes...

00:49:53.220 --> 00:49:56.530
This woman was frightened when she saw my face.

00:49:56.810 --> 00:49:58.620
That's why she stole the light.

00:50:00.640 --> 00:50:01.740
I won't forgive you!

00:50:05.280 --> 00:50:07.700
What's wrong, you weirdo?

00:50:08.200 --> 00:50:11.100
I see. Is your little sister that cute?

00:50:11.560 --> 00:50:13.760
If you want to save her, then kill her.

00:50:14.310 --> 00:50:15.740
Rei, don't get in her way.

00:50:16.260 --> 00:50:19.380
What's wrong? Isn't your little sister cute?

00:50:21.140 --> 00:50:25.720
Shut up, Rei!

00:50:25.820 --> 00:50:27.830
He's not the kind of guy who keeps his promises.

00:50:28.850 --> 00:50:29.680
You idiot!

00:50:30.660 --> 00:50:35.660
That's right. Brothers have to help each other.

00:50:36.160 --> 00:50:37.500
This woman has always admired you, her older brother.

00:50:39.180 --> 00:50:43.160
That's right. It is natural for sisters and brothers to respect their older brothers.

00:50:44.200 --> 00:50:48.210
That's right! I remember! I remember again!

00:50:48.490 --> 00:50:50.490
You always made fun of me!

00:50:50.870 --> 00:50:53.830
Jagi, will you be able to accept someone like you?

00:50:55.090 --> 00:50:59.890
Rely on the gun and become a hostage again!

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:02.120
I'm going to rely on you and this man with the Suichoken sword.

00:51:03.320 --> 00:51:05.850
Can't you defeat me on your own?

00:51:06.350 --> 00:51:09.430
Is this what you're saying to your brother?

00:51:09.810 --> 00:51:10.870
Respect me!

00:51:12.430 --> 00:51:13.840
J-Jagi-sama!

00:51:14.930 --> 00:51:18.140
I know. I'll settle this one-on-one with you.

00:51:21.120 --> 00:51:23.740
You guys, kill that weirdo!

00:51:25.120 --> 00:51:28.830
Hurry up and choose a place to die.

00:51:30.800 --> 00:51:31.440
You should die.

00:51:31.760 --> 00:51:44.640
I've lived only out of hatred for you.

00:51:45.420 --> 00:51:47.950
So you're saying that I'm the one who caused all this?

00:51:49.050 --> 00:51:49.670
Hmph.

00:51:49.670 --> 00:51:53.160
Those who don't respect me, I've killed them all.

00:51:53.360 --> 00:51:57.540
Those scumbags' lives are not worth the pain of this wound!

00:52:00.410 --> 00:52:03.030
Every time this wound hurts, I've been living by making you live.

00:52:04.390 --> 00:52:09.480
Jagi, why didn't you finish me off at that time and drop me into the valley?

00:52:09.860 --> 00:52:13.660
Hmph. Our big brother Raoh told me to do so.

00:52:14.180 --> 00:52:15.120
Raoh?

00:52:15.400 --> 00:52:20.100
I thought it would be interesting for you to die in a dark valley.

00:52:20.860 --> 00:52:24.320
Well, I'll let you taste hell again.

00:52:24.780 --> 00:52:26.760
I'm not the old Jagi.

00:52:49.740 --> 00:52:52.560
That's ridiculous!

00:52:52.860 --> 00:52:58.680
Use it. Don't overdo it.

00:52:58.680 --> 00:52:59.840
With a gun...

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:01.140
If you can kill me...

00:53:01.140 --> 00:53:02.880
You idiot! What do you want me to use?

00:53:02.880 --> 00:53:03.640
All I need to do is win!

00:53:04.040 --> 00:53:04.180
Huh?

00:53:04.480 --> 00:53:05.610
I've made a decision.

00:53:06.250 --> 00:53:09.140
If you don't talk now, your own finger will pull the trigger.

00:53:10.120 --> 00:53:11.320
Urgh...

00:53:11.320 --> 00:53:12.480
Kyaa...

00:53:12.880 --> 00:53:14.140
Kyaa...

00:53:14.140 --> 00:53:18.360
You're no longer the old Kenshiro.

00:53:19.060 --> 00:53:21.080
You're as great as you used to be.

00:53:21.080 --> 00:53:24.330
But your reading is still poor, Kenshiro!

00:53:30.090 --> 00:53:33.290
Hehehe, I had a trump card called gasoline.

00:53:33.830 --> 00:53:36.460
This building is facing you.

00:53:36.820 --> 00:53:38.580
Burn more ugly than me!

00:53:39.320 --> 00:53:40.870
You still don't get it?

00:53:41.210 --> 00:53:42.250
You're the one who's going to die!

00:53:43.080 --> 00:53:44.020
I'll slowly watch you burn black.

00:53:47.270 --> 00:53:49.430
Alright, I'll tell you about the maid's souvenir.

00:53:50.630 --> 00:53:53.670
You stole Yulia from me. What a true sword!

00:53:54.270 --> 00:53:56.030
I'm the one who made him go crazy!

00:53:57.930 --> 00:53:58.490
What?

00:53:58.890 --> 00:53:59.750
I'm your...

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.630
You became the legend of Hokuto Shinken, and then you even got Yuria.

00:54:05.230 --> 00:54:08.710
So I looked at Shin, who loved Yuria.

00:54:09.530 --> 00:54:11.850
And I lied to Shin.

00:54:12.110 --> 00:54:15.140
Shin, why don't you give up?

00:54:15.380 --> 00:54:17.640
You know that Kenshiro's sweet personality.

00:54:18.580 --> 00:54:21.680
In this day and age, he can't protect Yuria.

00:54:21.960 --> 00:54:23.460
He's bound to be taken away by another man.

00:54:24.220 --> 00:54:25.980
Is that okay, Shin?

00:54:26.260 --> 00:54:27.550
That's right.

00:54:27.630 --> 00:54:28.650
You're the one who can make Yuria happy.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.580
Yulia is a woman of some kind.

00:54:32.700 --> 00:54:34.140
There's nothing to be confused about.

00:54:34.600 --> 00:54:35.460
Take it away.

00:54:35.480 --> 00:54:36.580
Take it away.

00:54:36.640 --> 00:54:37.780
Take it away!

00:54:38.240 --> 00:54:41.580
You stole Shin?

00:54:41.820 --> 00:54:43.750
That's right.

00:54:43.830 --> 00:54:44.950
You fell for my plan.

00:54:45.770 --> 00:54:46.460
That's right.

00:54:46.560 --> 00:54:47.720
Is there a brother who is smarter than his brother?

00:54:49.260 --> 00:54:50.560
Are you frustrated?

00:54:50.960 --> 00:54:51.780
Are you frustrated?

00:54:52.060 --> 00:54:55.110
How is it?

00:54:56.130 --> 00:54:57.870
Shin grew up like a brother since he was a child.

00:55:00.410 --> 00:55:02.490
The one who stole Yulia from me is...

00:55:02.770 --> 00:55:04.590
Who am I?

00:55:05.330 --> 00:55:06.000
Say my name!

00:55:06.700 --> 00:55:09.820
I am the legendary Jani of the North Shinkens!

00:55:51.080 --> 00:55:51.560
That's the...

00:55:51.560 --> 00:55:51.800
...

00:55:51.990 --> 00:55:52.210
...

00:56:00.060 --> 00:56:01.060
Take this!

00:56:02.972 --> 00:56:04.972
Thank you for watching!

00:56:14.364 --> 00:56:17.564
Have you forgotten the essence of Hokuto Shinken?

00:56:30.440 --> 00:56:31.460
Ah...

00:56:35.190 --> 00:56:47.720
Where is Yuria?

00:56:48.800 --> 00:56:50.820
He lives in the southern city of the Southern Cross.

00:56:52.580 --> 00:56:53.740
Help me!

00:56:53.920 --> 00:56:54.460
It's useless.

00:56:54.800 --> 00:56:58.670
Your body will disappear from the ground in ten seconds.

00:57:00.540 --> 00:57:03.120
Y-Yuria's heart is already a real one.

00:57:03.460 --> 00:57:04.720
It's useless to say it.

00:57:05.520 --> 00:57:06.880
Are you frustrated?

00:57:07.220 --> 00:57:07.920
Take Kenshiro.

00:57:08.320 --> 00:57:10.320
Hokuto was given to me by my brother.

00:57:10.580 --> 00:57:11.580
So it's mine.

00:57:12.020 --> 00:57:12.620
What do you think?

00:57:13.640 --> 00:57:15.140
Kenshiro, try saying my name.

00:57:15.720 --> 00:57:17.380
I'm the successor of Hokuto.

00:57:18.000 --> 00:57:26.010
Then I'll fix it.

00:57:44.720 --> 00:57:47.070
Yes, I am. Your brother, Rei.

00:57:48.640 --> 00:57:52.400
Yes, my new friend. Please ask me anything.

00:57:53.260 --> 00:57:56.120
I will do anything. Please be cute.

00:58:10.720 --> 00:58:18.360
Airi, Airi, Kenshiro, is your sister really going back to normal?

00:58:18.880 --> 00:58:23.020
A harsh day has taken away your sister's memory and light.

00:58:23.600 --> 00:58:26.630
After a while, she will regain consciousness.

00:58:38.410 --> 00:58:38.830
...Sansan...

00:58:38.830 --> 00:58:50.300
...U-U-U-U-U-U-U-USS

00:58:50.300 --> 00:58:59.980
...U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-USS

00:59:05.500 --> 00:59:06.340
I'm going to get married.

00:59:07.340 --> 00:59:10.000
That's right, Aili. You're supposed to look at me.

00:59:13.730 --> 00:59:14.590
That's right, I'm.

00:59:15.580 --> 00:59:16.580
Let's open the door and see this one.

00:59:20.560 --> 00:59:21.120
I've already been washed.

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:33.100
No, Airi is afraid to open her eyes.

00:59:33.960 --> 00:59:37.110
I'm fine with this. I don't want to see anything anymore.

00:59:37.250 --> 00:59:41.380
That's right. In a world like this, that might be happier.

00:59:42.320 --> 00:59:44.870
Yes, I have no choice but to live as I am washed away.

00:59:45.990 --> 00:59:49.700
Don't say that. I'm going to make another place where it's easier to live.

00:59:51.630 --> 00:59:59.570
If we all do our best, flowers, trees, tomatoes, apples, wheat...

01:00:00.090 --> 01:00:00.970
I can make a lot of things!

01:00:33.100 --> 01:00:34.840
We can find another way to find the reaction.

01:00:35.560 --> 01:00:50.540
As a woman, as a man, in this era of unhappiness.

01:02:09.500 --> 01:02:12.430
Hmph, Yullian, you're as beautiful as ever.

01:02:19.300 --> 01:02:22.570
Again? Yullian, don't you like the jewel I sent you?

01:02:23.170 --> 01:02:24.470
Don't you like this life?

01:02:25.310 --> 01:02:28.760
I want to die.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:38.800
Kindness like the sea, the radiance of the grassland, the warm light like the sun, and the scent of the earth that envelops me.

01:02:39.690 --> 01:02:44.750
The scent of the earth? You mean Kenshiro? He's already dead.

01:02:45.150 --> 01:02:53.670
Yuria, you are the most luxurious woman in the world at this time. What else do you want?

01:02:55.630 --> 01:02:58.670
My wish is to bring Minori back to this land one more time.

01:03:00.090 --> 01:03:02.990
Minori? What are you talking about, Yuria?

01:03:03.110 --> 01:03:05.880
In this day and age, there is no more soil that can nourish nature.

01:03:06.760 --> 01:03:09.400
Look. The soil we have now is dead soil.

01:03:09.580 --> 01:03:14.250
That wilderness is a world of death.

01:03:14.650 --> 01:03:16.810
Not a single grass has grown.

01:03:17.030 --> 01:03:21.120
But look at this city of Southern Cross.

01:03:21.560 --> 01:03:23.720
The only thing that was built for me and you.

01:03:26.200 --> 01:03:29.070
In this city alone is another world.

01:03:31.240 --> 01:03:35.260
You will raise my child and live in peace in this town.

01:03:35.400 --> 01:03:39.970
In our generation, that soil will come back to life.

01:03:40.280 --> 01:03:42.040
There is no such thing as green.

01:03:42.040 --> 01:03:46.000
What else is there to survive in this era than violence?

01:03:48.420 --> 01:03:49.880
I was the only one who could make you happy.

01:03:51.650 --> 01:03:52.290
Yulia.

01:03:52.910 --> 01:03:56.040
Tenshiro was destined to be killed by someone, not me.

01:03:58.180 --> 01:03:58.820
Yulia.

01:03:59.380 --> 01:03:59.840
I'm going to...

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:02.180
Open your heart. Kenshiro died along with that soil.

01:04:03.100 --> 01:04:09.420
Yulia, what a beautiful name.

01:04:10.850 --> 01:04:13.210
Yulia has the same blood as you.

01:04:13.690 --> 01:04:19.620
Father Ryuken suggested that I marry Yulia to the legend of Hokuto Shinken.

01:04:21.860 --> 01:04:28.980
Your father must have sent something to this era by merging the north and the south, Kenshiro.

01:04:30.220 --> 01:04:30.880
He's a strange man.

01:04:31.180 --> 01:04:34.060
I can smell the smell of the soil from those days.

01:04:35.460 --> 01:04:39.400
Maybe you're the one who has to stop this era of violence.

01:04:41.500 --> 01:04:44.430
I don't have any such ambitions.

01:04:45.030 --> 01:04:49.420
I just want to get back Yuria and take over Hokuto's will.

01:04:51.400 --> 01:04:57.620
Don't worry.

01:04:57.880 --> 01:04:59.430
I'll make you move.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:02.000
Well, I think it's not that much.

01:05:15.292 --> 01:05:16.292
Cigai no Yamada!

01:05:32.720 --> 01:05:36.050
If you want to kill me, then this is my head.

01:05:36.310 --> 01:05:41.680
I just want to kill you in a funny way.

01:05:42.300 --> 01:05:49.770
If you want to kill me, then this is my head.

01:05:49.890 --> 01:05:53.800
I'll kill you!

01:05:53.980 --> 01:05:57.100
I'll kill you!

01:06:02.970 --> 01:06:05.500
I'll show you what I've got!

01:06:10.600 --> 01:06:29.980
I'll show you what I've got!

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:30.780
Don't you know what that means?

01:06:31.900 --> 01:06:51.140
Now, my body is like iron armor.

01:06:51.780 --> 01:06:52.620
Come at me from anywhere!

01:07:00.480 --> 01:07:04.320
I told you not to do that to my body!

01:07:07.970 --> 01:07:14.650
I'll take care of the rest.

01:07:14.730 --> 01:07:15.790
Come on!

01:07:30.800 --> 01:07:31.080
Yeah!

01:07:43.020 --> 01:07:50.980
Hey, King of Swords.

01:07:51.380 --> 01:07:54.230
If you want to lose your subordinates even more,

01:07:54.570 --> 01:07:55.920
you'll have to fight me first.

01:07:57.600 --> 01:07:59.430
Now, come at me!

01:08:00.440 --> 01:08:04.430
You're a hundred years too early to fight the Lord of the Swords!

01:08:04.590 --> 01:08:09.270
I'm going to smash you into pieces!

01:08:10.990 --> 01:08:16.140
I'm going to use this weird technique of yours and crush you!

01:08:22.740 --> 01:08:27.270
Why did you hit me?

01:08:31.370 --> 01:08:34.210
I told you I don't care what you do to my body!

01:08:35.010 --> 01:08:39.160
What are you going to do with your hands?

01:08:40.940 --> 01:08:43.120
Alright, get ready to fight!

01:08:45.500 --> 01:08:58.800
My body is made of steel!

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:00.700
What did you say?

01:09:04.310 --> 01:09:12.340
I won't be of any use to the times.

01:09:13.120 --> 01:09:14.200
Kill me.

01:09:14.360 --> 01:09:18.490
Yulia, I won't have to fight again.

01:09:19.150 --> 01:09:22.170
The so-called Sword King is invading the land.

01:09:23.110 --> 01:09:24.660
He is approaching the Southern Cross.

01:09:25.880 --> 01:09:27.360
I will pray for your good fortune.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:32.580
That's all you have to say? I'm going to fight for my life and death.

01:09:35.830 --> 01:09:37.700
The sword king's army has crossed the G-point.

01:09:38.360 --> 01:09:42.440
What? The sword king? What is he planning in this era?

01:09:43.960 --> 01:09:48.280
And one more thing. The Jyagi, who was known as the legend of Hokuto Shinken, has been defeated.

01:09:48.850 --> 01:09:52.760
The one who defeated him is Kenshiro, who has seven wounds on his chest.

01:10:05.700 --> 01:10:07.050
I'm going to live here.

01:10:07.050 --> 01:10:07.390
I'm going to live here.

01:10:08.540 --> 01:10:09.880
But today I'm going to live here.

01:10:11.880 --> 01:10:14.440
I'm going to live here.

01:10:33.484 --> 01:10:33.984
Oh

01:11:01.880 --> 01:11:03.520
Where is Yuria? Find Yuria!

01:11:03.760 --> 01:11:04.860
Alright, be careful.

01:11:05.360 --> 01:11:06.590
Hey, is Yuria here?

01:11:07.240 --> 01:11:08.700
I'm sorry, but that's not the point.

01:11:09.200 --> 01:11:10.570
The King's army is very close.

01:11:10.890 --> 01:11:12.980
That's not the point, huh?

01:11:13.650 --> 01:11:15.570
Forgive me, but...

01:11:16.590 --> 01:11:18.980
You! This country exists because Yuria is here.

01:11:19.920 --> 01:11:22.600
Yuria is everything to me!

01:12:35.280 --> 01:12:36.300
You're here, King of the Swordsmen.

01:12:37.530 --> 01:12:39.850
But Yuria, I've only fought for you.

01:12:41.910 --> 01:12:44.050
My only goal is to get you.

01:12:45.630 --> 01:12:49.780
Now that you've disappeared, I...

01:13:00.280 --> 01:13:00.940
You're the king of the sword?

01:13:02.180 --> 01:13:04.420
I'm the one who took care of your woman.

01:13:04.420 --> 01:13:04.780
What?

01:13:10.610 --> 01:13:12.830
So you came all the way here to get killed?

01:13:12.970 --> 01:13:16.410
I'm glad. Thanks to you, the head priest has come back to life.

01:13:16.510 --> 01:13:18.670
I'll kill you and bring back Yuria.

01:13:19.850 --> 01:13:20.530
That's right.

01:13:20.800 --> 01:13:22.640
If that's not the case, it's not like you.

01:13:23.020 --> 01:13:24.420
Now, come at me.

01:13:24.900 --> 01:13:25.300
Die!

01:14:10.680 --> 01:14:12.060
The city of Southern Cross...

01:14:12.940 --> 01:14:13.100
Yulia...

01:14:59.660 --> 01:14:59.820
Okay.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:03.730
Genjiro, I'm glad you came all the way here. I'll praise you.

01:15:04.090 --> 01:15:07.220
I came back from the bottom of hell to defeat you.

01:15:08.270 --> 01:15:10.510
What made you change so much?

01:15:10.630 --> 01:15:11.520
A habit.

01:15:12.350 --> 01:15:15.050
You're the one who taught me how to change myself.

01:15:15.090 --> 01:15:16.740
It's a habit.

01:15:18.400 --> 01:15:21.410
Then I'll see how much of that habit you have.

01:15:23.030 --> 01:15:24.120
Where's Yuria?

01:15:24.700 --> 01:15:27.080
If you want, take it with your own hands.

01:15:27.720 --> 01:15:28.800
Die, Genjiro!

01:15:33.000 --> 01:15:39.930
You're not the old Kenshiro, are you?

01:15:40.580 --> 01:15:43.610
Shin, I've seen through all of your moves.

01:16:00.350 --> 01:16:03.880
Shin, those scars are my sword.

01:16:04.810 --> 01:16:06.240
Ken Shiro, it's too late.

01:16:09.560 --> 01:16:13.280
Don't forgive me. I don't need this Shiro or my power.

01:16:14.220 --> 01:16:19.100
But in Yuria's heart, you were always there.

01:16:19.750 --> 01:16:22.000
Your illusion.

01:16:23.070 --> 01:16:24.180
Shin, where is Yuria?

01:16:35.080 --> 01:16:36.880
It's the wedding dress that Yuria was supposed to wear for me.

01:16:39.840 --> 01:16:41.840
But Yuria is no longer here.

01:16:41.940 --> 01:16:42.240
What?

01:16:42.750 --> 01:16:45.900
Yuria is in the hands of Raoh.

01:16:46.790 --> 01:16:50.300
The end of the century.

01:16:50.700 --> 01:16:54.100
It's the transformation of your brother, Raoh.

01:16:54.530 --> 01:16:55.390
Raoh?

01:16:55.890 --> 01:16:58.200
He said it was a message to you.

01:17:01.720 --> 01:17:05.180
Leave the fist of Hokuto and go to me.

01:17:05.460 --> 01:17:07.720
Kenshiro.

01:17:07.720 --> 01:17:09.390
Raoh is waiting for the demon.

01:17:09.950 --> 01:17:11.320
Cassandra is here.

01:17:11.800 --> 01:17:12.340
Cassandra.

01:17:12.850 --> 01:17:13.810
Waiting for the demon.

01:17:13.850 --> 01:17:15.800
I love Yuria.

01:17:16.080 --> 01:17:19.840
If I die, I want to die in your hands.

01:17:22.140 --> 01:17:24.360
I love the same woman as a man.

01:17:25.340 --> 01:17:25.760
Uwaa.

01:17:26.620 --> 01:17:26.760
Die.

01:17:27.130 --> 01:17:27.670
Uwaa.

01:17:27.670 --> 01:17:28.330
Uwaa.

01:18:00.730 --> 01:18:01.470
I loved the same woman.

01:18:33.900 --> 01:18:41.480
Oh my god!

01:18:42.320 --> 01:18:43.900
The tempo is getting slow!

01:18:44.420 --> 01:18:47.770
Let's eat!

01:19:18.970 --> 01:19:20.830
It's the Fascia of the end of the century, the Fascia of the King of Swords.

01:19:22.160 --> 01:19:28.530
Stop it, stop it. You're going to be crushed.

01:19:30.760 --> 01:19:31.180
Oh, my God.

01:20:08.280 --> 01:20:08.480
Thank you for watching!

01:20:30.060 --> 01:20:32.060
You

01:21:28.960 --> 01:21:29.560
With all my might

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:30.980
I took control of everything.

01:21:31.240 --> 01:21:33.410
Those who stood up were killed.

01:21:34.130 --> 01:21:37.280
There is no problem with Hokuto in front of me.

01:21:38.000 --> 01:21:39.610
I grabbed the Heavenly King.

01:21:40.190 --> 01:21:42.110
I called myself the Heavenly King.

01:21:42.850 --> 01:21:47.910
But something is happening.

01:21:48.960 --> 01:21:50.800
But it's too early.

01:21:51.060 --> 01:21:51.980
Too early.

01:21:52.300 --> 01:21:58.520
What did you say?

01:21:58.520 --> 01:21:58.620
Huh?

01:21:59.360 --> 01:21:59.840
I...

01:22:00.510 --> 01:22:02.840
There's no doubt about it.

01:22:03.090 --> 01:22:05.190
I mean, Yuria-san is supposed to be in Southern Cross!

01:22:06.210 --> 01:22:09.500
That's why I'm saying...

01:22:09.500 --> 01:22:11.950
There's no doubt about it. That's Yuria-san.

01:22:12.050 --> 01:22:15.100
There's something going on, and she's here.

01:22:16.120 --> 01:22:19.900
But if Rin says that, it's Yuria-san, right?

01:22:20.360 --> 01:22:22.690
Yeah. She's somewhere else, after all.

01:22:23.230 --> 01:22:26.250
Alright! If that's the case, let's go find out!

01:22:26.430 --> 01:22:28.600
Find out? How?

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:30.700
There's an underground tunnel in Cassandra's castle.

01:22:31.520 --> 01:22:32.790
I'm sure Yuria-san is there.

01:22:33.390 --> 01:22:33.770
What?

01:22:35.480 --> 01:22:37.380
I even made a cosodrome to survive!

01:22:37.840 --> 01:22:39.650
Leave this to me!

01:22:39.970 --> 01:22:40.370
Right?

01:22:41.200 --> 01:22:45.060
So, we just need to find the entrance to the underground tunnel.

01:22:47.800 --> 01:22:50.020
The water source used to be in the south,

01:22:50.680 --> 01:22:52.720
and the slope from the river was 3.5 degrees,

01:22:52.900 --> 01:22:55.760
and the route of the waste from the factory was...

01:22:59.530 --> 01:22:59.790
What the

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:00.920
You don't have to go.

01:23:01.060 --> 01:23:02.530
I just want to make sure if it's Yuria or not.

01:23:03.930 --> 01:23:05.750
No, I want to see Yuria.

01:23:06.450 --> 01:23:09.690
I want to show her this flower and cheer her up.

01:23:10.670 --> 01:23:26.320
No, I'll get rusty and become a victim.

01:23:30.570 --> 01:23:31.190
Can I get out of here?

01:24:01.530 --> 01:24:02.270
This flower...

01:24:02.270 --> 01:24:03.550
It's your flower, Yuria-san.

01:24:03.550 --> 01:24:03.890
What?

01:24:04.580 --> 01:24:08.160
Yuria-san gave this flower to Ken, and Ken gave it to me.

01:24:08.480 --> 01:24:08.920
Ken...

01:24:08.920 --> 01:24:11.430
Kenshiro...

01:24:11.480 --> 01:24:13.150
Kenshiro...

01:24:13.150 --> 01:24:14.460
Yuria-san, be brave.

01:24:15.060 --> 01:24:15.960
That's right!

01:24:16.200 --> 01:24:17.850
Ken will definitely come to save me!

01:24:18.390 --> 01:24:19.920
You must not tell Kenshiro.

01:24:21.560 --> 01:24:22.040
Why?

01:24:22.620 --> 01:24:24.340
Something terrible will happen.

01:24:24.580 --> 01:24:24.740
What?

01:24:25.270 --> 01:24:27.850
We are destined not to be united in this world.

01:24:28.170 --> 01:24:29.670
I...

01:24:30.160 --> 01:24:31.160
I was prepared to be locked up here.

01:24:31.980 --> 01:24:32.380
No!

01:24:32.880 --> 01:24:35.500
The only way to save Ms. Yulia is to...

01:24:35.620 --> 01:24:35.640
Ah!

01:24:35.900 --> 01:24:40.340
Get out of here.

01:24:40.440 --> 01:24:44.360
Chirou...

01:25:02.430 --> 01:25:03.150
What's wrong with that flower?

01:25:04.070 --> 01:25:07.040
It's a dark age now.

01:25:07.040 --> 01:25:08.480
Flowers can't bloom.

01:25:08.920 --> 01:25:11.800
The age still wants flowers to bloom.

01:25:12.380 --> 01:25:21.450
The execution of the Japanese army begins!

01:25:21.970 --> 01:25:28.610
Look at the flower!

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:34.940
A flower! A flower! A flower!

01:25:34.980 --> 01:25:36.720
A flower is blooming!

01:25:37.430 --> 01:25:39.830
I can't believe I'm seeing a flower again!

01:25:40.650 --> 01:25:43.100
The earth... the earth is still alive.

01:25:43.760 --> 01:25:46.560
The king is thrilled to see this flower.

01:25:48.680 --> 01:25:52.210
The one who made me bloom is among you.

01:25:52.470 --> 01:25:56.880
The one who comes forward will kill this woman!

01:26:00.280 --> 01:26:00.660
W-what?

01:26:01.240 --> 01:26:05.370
I'll save Yuria.

01:26:05.370 --> 01:26:12.820
I'm a rei of Sui-Chou-Ken!

01:26:13.380 --> 01:26:17.600
Following the Ken-Oh,

01:26:18.200 --> 01:26:20.070
the flower is born by the legend of Hokuto-Shinken,

01:26:20.890 --> 01:26:21.760
Kenshiro!

01:26:22.640 --> 01:26:24.710
Kenshiro?

01:26:25.240 --> 01:26:28.560
The flower is Kenshiro and Yuria.

01:26:28.700 --> 01:26:29.540
And...

01:26:30.000 --> 01:26:31.480
Rin's love has blossomed!

01:26:33.660 --> 01:26:36.510
Love? There's no need for love in this dark world.

01:26:38.420 --> 01:26:39.520
Weigle!

01:26:40.300 --> 01:26:41.000
Hehehe...

01:26:41.000 --> 01:26:47.980
Now, taste the wrath of this Weigle-sama!

01:26:50.460 --> 01:26:53.160
I'm here to defeat the Sword King.

01:26:54.160 --> 01:26:56.680
I don't have time to care about little things like you.

01:27:08.890 --> 01:27:11.990
What's wrong?

01:27:12.170 --> 01:27:14.500
You're moving too slow, you're making me yawn.

01:27:15.400 --> 01:27:17.350
I'll beat you to death!

01:27:18.040 --> 01:27:26.630
I don't think I'll be able to tie you this time.

01:27:30.830 --> 01:27:43.150
Ken-O, it's your turn next.

01:27:43.720 --> 01:27:45.030
I'm angry!

01:27:45.410 --> 01:27:48.960
As expected of the spirit of growth.

01:27:49.720 --> 01:27:51.030
It's a wonderful thing.

01:28:13.880 --> 01:28:19.150
Don't worry. I'm a man who can only return the sword and you by fighting.

01:28:19.550 --> 01:28:21.980
The next era is waiting for you.

01:28:23.000 --> 01:28:29.340
You seem to understand a little, but...

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:34.040
My time has yet to pass. Don't you think so, Rei?

01:28:34.680 --> 01:28:37.930
Time is in a hurry. Die here, King of Swords.

01:28:38.540 --> 01:28:41.530
Very well. I was destined to fight with you.

01:28:42.670 --> 01:28:43.790
Come from anywhere.

01:28:44.790 --> 01:28:46.960
Get off the horse, King of Swords!

01:28:47.620 --> 01:28:52.870
Did you think you could make me stand on the ground with your own hands?

01:28:54.130 --> 01:28:55.390
There is no man in this world who can make me stand on the ground.

01:28:58.190 --> 01:28:59.590
You bastard!

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:00.300
Heeey!

01:31:50.160 --> 01:31:51.320
Some in his

01:32:21.150 --> 01:32:23.980
Taka... Kenshiro... Rao...

01:32:37.870 --> 01:32:38.590
Raoh...

01:32:39.960 --> 01:32:44.420
I abandoned the name Raoh a long time ago.

01:32:44.420 --> 01:32:47.020
I am the end of the century.

01:32:47.140 --> 01:32:50.910
Now I am the legendary man, Ken-O.

01:32:52.120 --> 01:32:55.030
Kenshiro, if you want Yuria, defeat me!

01:33:14.720 --> 01:33:18.930
Die, Ken.

01:33:21.400 --> 01:33:21.820
We're in the same room.

01:33:22.000 --> 01:33:28.260
If we bump into each other, even if we defeat the opponent, we'll be crushed to pieces.

01:33:30.440 --> 01:33:45.430
I have to live. Even if it's a fight, it's the same as losing.

01:33:45.610 --> 01:33:55.720
I have to continue to live for Rin, Yuria, and everyone else.

01:34:00.540 --> 01:34:02.960
Don't die, Kenshiro.

01:34:04.740 --> 01:34:05.400
Die!

01:34:16.880 --> 01:34:19.650
I've been awake for two thousand years!

01:34:24.510 --> 01:34:28.440
Go, go, Kenshiro!

01:34:32.110 --> 01:34:50.360
What you saw was my sword, ORA.

01:34:50.620 --> 01:34:53.400
I'll tell you one more thing.

01:34:53.940 --> 01:34:56.600
I'm the one who killed our father, Ryukyun.

01:35:12.030 --> 01:35:27.820
You're the first one to make me look at you like that!

01:35:27.820 --> 01:35:28.740
Shut up!

01:35:36.140 --> 01:35:36.840
I can see your aura.

01:35:37.640 --> 01:35:39.780
Come, Kenshiro.

01:35:39.860 --> 01:35:41.310
I'll show you your growth.

01:35:42.990 --> 01:35:45.450
You can see it with your own eyes.

01:36:08.440 --> 01:36:11.620
Oh, no!

01:37:05.210 --> 01:37:05.330
Oh, my God.

01:37:31.600 --> 01:37:42.160
Karo, now that you've hurt my body, I have to stand on the same ground as you.

01:37:43.040 --> 01:37:49.600
Your body and soul are far beyond my imagination.

01:37:51.200 --> 01:37:54.290
After all, your life has to stand here.

01:37:55.270 --> 01:37:57.000
Nnngh!

01:38:19.356 --> 01:38:20.116
Oh my god

01:38:30.030 --> 01:38:30.490
Uh...

01:41:00.830 --> 01:41:02.660
Mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm.

01:41:30.600 --> 01:41:32.480
Oh, please stop it.

01:41:33.020 --> 01:41:36.450
It's you, after all.

01:41:36.570 --> 01:41:40.390
I don't know.

01:41:40.790 --> 01:41:43.200
I was watching you.

01:41:43.760 --> 01:41:46.880
You should be relieved.

01:41:47.280 --> 01:41:49.370
Kenshiro won't die.

01:41:49.590 --> 01:41:52.410
And I can't fall either.

01:41:53.490 --> 01:41:57.510
Why are you still too young?

01:42:03.570 --> 01:42:08.850
Do you like a creep?

01:42:35.470 --> 01:42:37.410
Ugh...

01:42:37.410 --> 01:42:41.640
Take this, Kenshiro Rin.

01:42:42.410 --> 01:42:44.280
Today is not the end.

01:42:44.900 --> 01:42:47.560
Today is the beginning of your battle.

01:43:25.468 --> 01:43:26.908
I blew everything away.

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:32.670
Yuri-san and the two of you will come to us again.

01:43:33.430 --> 01:43:56.090
I was hit by a bat!

01:45:00.440 --> 01:45:00.700
Thank you.

01:45:32.590 --> 01:45:32.970
Thank you.
